    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27405" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Lȳsĭmăchīa</span></b> ,
			ae, f., or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Lȳsĭmă-chēa</span></b> , =
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λυσιμάχεια</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a city in Thrace</i>, now <i>Examili</i>, Mela, 2, 2, 6; <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 11,
