				32, 34, 6 al.</span></i>—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Lȳsĭmăchĭ-enses</span></b> ,
				ĭum, m., <i>the Lysimachians</i>, <i><span class="en">Liv. 33,
				38, 12</span></i>.</div>
